# FoodRescue API: ready-made test requests
#
# How to use (VS Code):
#   1. Install the "REST Client" extension (by Huachao Mao).
#   2. Start the backend:  cd backend  ->  npm run dev
#   3. Click "Send Request" above any request below.
#   4. Run the LOGIN requests first: the other requests reuse their tokens automatically.
#
# Every demo account uses the password Password123.

@base = http://localhost:5000/api

### 0. Health check (no login needed)
GET {{base}}/health

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- LOGINS (run these first)

# @name admin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@foodrescue.test", "password": "Password123" }

###
# @name restaurant
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "restaurant@foodrescue.test", "password": "Password123" }

###
# @name ngo
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ngo@foodrescue.test", "password": "Password123" }

###
# @name volunteer
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "volunteer@foodrescue.test", "password": "Password123" }

### Wrong password (expect 401)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ngo@foodrescue.test", "password": "wrong-password1" }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- PUBLIC

### Food categories (14)
GET {{base}}/categories

### Areas (manual location fallback)
GET {{base}}/areas

### Public NGO directory for households, nearest first
GET {{base}}/ngos?area=DHA Phase 2

### Directory filtered by type
GET {{base}}/ngos?ngoType=ORPHANAGE

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- RESTAURANT (Savour Foods)

### My profile
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{restaurant.response.body.token}}

### My listings
GET {{base}}/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{restaurant.response.body.token}}

### Post surplus food (change the times to later today if you like)
POST {{base}}/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{restaurant.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 2,
  "description": "Chicken biryani, end-of-day surplus",
  "confirmedQuantity": 40,
  "preparedAt": "{{$datetime iso8601 -1 h}}",
  "safeUntil": "{{$datetime iso8601 4 h}}",
  "collectionDeadline": "{{$datetime iso8601 3 h}}",
  "dietaryInfo": "Halal",
  "handlingNotes": "Packed in foil trays",
  "safetyConfirmed": true
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- NGO (Rizq)

### Open listings the NGO can see (exact address hidden until an offer is accepted)
GET {{base}}/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{ngo.response.body.token}}

### My requests
GET {{base}}/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{ngo.response.body.token}}

### Create a request (limited by the NGO's daily capacity)
POST {{base}}/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{ngo.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": 1, "requestedQuantity": 50, "requiredBy": "{{$datetime iso8601 6 h}}", "notes": "Evening meal" }

### My offers (allocations): accept or reject the PROPOSED ones below
GET {{base}}/allocations
Authorization: Bearer {{ngo.response.body.token}}

### Accept an offer (put a real allocation id from the list above)
POST {{base}}/allocations/1/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{ngo.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### My reliability score
GET {{base}}/reliability/me
Authorization: Bearer {{ngo.response.body.token}}

### My notifications
GET {{base}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{ngo.response.body.token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- VOLUNTEER (Hassan Raza)

### Tasks I can claim (most urgent first)
GET {{base}}/tasks/available
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteer.response.body.token}}

### Combined pickup trips (the seeded Rizq trip: Savour Foods + Kabul Restaurant)
# @name trips
GET {{base}}/tasks/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteer.response.body.token}}

### Claim the first trip (all stops at once)
POST {{base}}/tasks/trips/{{trips.response.body.trips[0].requestId}}/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "taskIds": {{trips.response.body.trips[0].taskIds}} }

### My tasks
GET {{base}}/tasks/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteer.response.body.token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- ADMIN

### Accounts waiting for approval
GET {{base}}/admin/verifications
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### All users
GET {{base}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### Reliability scores of all NGOs (weakest first)
GET {{base}}/admin/reliability?role=NGO
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### System settings
GET {{base}}/admin/config
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### Live concurrency demo: 10 simultaneous allocations with and without the lock (takes a while over Neon)
POST {{base}}/admin/demo/concurrency
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "attempts": 6, "compare": true }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- SECURITY CHECKS

### No token (expect 401)
GET {{base}}/auth/me

### Wrong role: a volunteer calling an admin route (expect 403)
GET {{base}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteer.response.body.token}}

### Invalid input (expect 400 with field errors)
POST {{base}}/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{ngo.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": "abc", "requestedQuantity": -5 }
